  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal Readiness for Climate Finance and Climate Investments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The S-CDTA seeks to strengthen the legal and regulatory capacities of DMCs to meet their mitigation commitments and adaptation needs under the Paris Agreement. The diagnostic studies will identify various legal and regulatory barriers to accessing international climate finance and to implementing NDCs, which is an essential step to ensuring that DMCs have adequate financing means to achieve their climate targets.</narrative>
  </description>
